    "innovation": "This paper extends the EPA's modeling framework to show that reducing U.S. vehicle emissions has substantial, long-term benefits for sea-level rise that are regionally amplified along U.S. coastlines, far exceeding the negligible impacts suggested by short-term, global analyses.",
